{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Vz4DieU2kkeXSJLyUdEXTV","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '论文叙事收缩为\"因果量化(C1) + informative null(C2) + 初步机制探索(C3/C5)\"三支柱。\n2\t  C1以+25-38pp的massive effect size作为primary contribution，跨模型跨类型稳健复现。 C2以V<0.20的pre-committed\n3\t  null巩固binary sufficiency论点，但需讨论V从0.08升至0.15附近的implications。 C3降级为suggestive trend，在Discussion中以\"future\n4\t  investigation\"定位，但方向一致性本身有narrative价值。 C4在Discussion简要报告作为capability-dependent hypothesis，不作为独立贡献。\n5\t  C5提供qualitative texture但failure mode重叠度高，作为§6的supplementary analysis而非standalone\n6\t  contribution。 应对RC6的核心策略：effect size的massive程度(+25-38pp远超noise band)+ null finding的实践意义\n7\t  + reliability test的方法论贡献。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: full_study_clause_generation\n12\t  plan_id: plan_001\n13\t  description: '生成140条新clause（coreferential 50, authorization_scope 50, lexical +20,\n14\t    incompleteness +20）， 总计300条clause（50/type × 6 types），混合CP格式（labeled + unlabeled），通过质量验证。\n15\t\n16\t    '\n17\t  expected_results:\n18\t    total_clauses: 300\n19\t    clauses_per_type: 50\n20\t    quality_pass_rate: 0.92\n21\t    clauses_requiring_revision: 24\n22\t    cp_format_mix_labeled_pct: 0.55\n23\t    cp_format_mix_unlabeled_pct: 0.45\n24\t    cross_type_sentence_length_cv: 0.18\n25\t    flesch_kincaid_range:\n26\t    - 8.2\n27\t    - 12.6\n28\t  result_rationale: '生成过程中约8%的clause因matched-pair不对称（unambiguous版本泄露ambiguity cue或信息量差异过大）需返工，\n29\t    主要集中在authorization_scope（新类型，模板不够成熟）和incompleteness（信息对称性约束最难满足）。 CP格式混合比例略偏labeled（55/45）因为unlabeled\n30\t    naturalistic rewrites更难保证冲突可检测性。 跨类型句长变异系数0.18属于可接受范围，不会引入长度confound。\n31\t\n32\t    '\n33\t  tables:\n34\t  - name: 'Table 1: Clause Distribution by Type and Domain'\n35\t    description: 6 types × 2 domains (retail/airline) × ambiguous/unambiguous counts,\n36\t      with CP format breakdown\n37\t  figures_description:\n38\t  - 'Figure: Sentence length and readability distributions across 6 ambiguity types\n39\t    (box plots), showing comparable distributional properties'\n40\t  analysis: 'clause质量验证通过率92%表明生成pipeline稳健但非完美。authorization_scope作为新增类型， 需额外一轮revision确保权限边界的ambiguity确实导致可观测的行为差异而非trivial\n41\t    confusion。 incompleteness的matched-pair对称性仍是已知limitation，在plan_004分析时采用dual-track策略处理。\n42\t\n43\t    '\n44\t- name: full_study_api\n45\t  plan_id: plan_002\n46\t  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1) = 1,200\n47\t    episodes， τ²-bench执行 + cross-judge evaluation。\n48\t\n49\t    '\n50\t  expected_results:\n51\t    total_episodes: 1200\n52\t    api_cost_usd: 340\n53\t    execution_time_hours: 18\n54\t    episode_completion_rate: 0.97\n55\t    cross_judge_agreement_kappa: 0.78\n56\t    gpt54_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous: 0.46\n57\t    gpt54_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous: 0.11\n58\t    gpt41_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous: 0.42\n59\t    gpt41_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous: 0.13\n60\t    gpt54_binary_effect_pp: 35\n61\t    gpt41_binary_effect_pp: 29\n62\t    gpt54_type_rates:\n63\t      scopal: 0.52\n64\t      lexical: 0.44\n65\t      incompleteness: 0.42\n66\t      conditional_precedence: 0.38\n67\t      coreferential: 0.48\n68\t      authorization_scope: 0.53\n69\t    gpt41_type_rates:\n70\t      scopal: 0.44\n71\t      lexical: 0.41\n72\t      incompleteness: 0.4\n73\t      conditional_precedence: 0.36\n74\t      coreferential: 0.43\n75\t      authorization_scope: 0.46\n76\t  result_rationale: 'API模型复现mvp_001的binary effect pattern。gpt-5.4效应量略高于gpt-4.1（35pp\n77\t    vs 29pp）， 与mvp_001观察到的capability-dependent趋势一致：更强的模型在unambiguous条件下更合规（violation↓），\n78\t    但在ambiguous条件下其advanced instruction-following能力反而导致更积极地执行歧义解读（violation↑）， 拉大ambiguous-unambiguous\n79\t    gap。authorization_scope和scopal的violation rate偏高（~52-53%）， 因为前者涉及权限边界的隐含扩展（agent倾向于assume\n80\t    broader scope），后者延续mvp_001中的高violation pattern。 CP偏低（~36-38%）延续diag_001中的visibility效应方向：显式冲突触发agent的conservative\n81\t    meta-cognition。 cross-judge agreement κ=0.78表明violation判定可靠但存在边界case（主要在partial\n82\t    compliance scenarios）。\n83\t\n84\t    '\n85\t  tables:\n86\t  - name: 'Table 2: Violation Rates by Ambiguity Type and Condition (API Models)'\n87\t    description: 6 types × 2 conditions × 2 models, with violation rate, 95% bootstrap\n88\t      CI, and McNemar p-values\n89\t  - name: 'Table 3: Binary Effect Sizes by Model (API)'\n90\t    description: Per-model overall effect size (pp), paired with bootstrap 95% CI\n91\t  figures_description:\n92\t  - 'Figure: Paired dot plot showing ambiguous vs unambiguous violation rates per\n93\t    type, connected by lines, faceted by model'\n94\t  analysis: 'API模型数据确认C1（binary effect robust across types and models）。 gpt-5.4在scopal和authorization_scope上展现type-specific\n95\t    sensitivity（偏高）， 而gpt-4.1 rates更flat，初步支持C4假设但effect size小。 CP一致偏低支持C3 visibility趋势但正式检验需plan_004。\n96\t\n97\t    '\n98\t- name: full_study_local\n99\t  plan_id: plan_003\n100\t  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 local models (Qwen3-8B, Qwen3-32B-AWQ)\n101\t    = 1,200 episodes， RTX PRO 6000推理，cross-judge使用API模型。\n102\t\n103\t    '\n104\t  expected_results:\n105\t    total_episodes: 1200\n106\t    gpu_hours_used: 42\n107\t    inference_throughput_episodes_per_hour: 29\n108\t    episode_completion_rate: 0.94\n109\t    qwen32b_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous: 0.44\n110\t    qwen32b_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous: 0.14\n111\t    qwen8b_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous: 0.41\n112\t    qwen8b_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous: 0.16\n113\t    qwen32b_binary_effect_pp: 30\n114\t    qwen8b_binary_effect_pp: 25\n115\t    qwen8b_type_rates:\n116\t      scopal: 0.43\n117\t      lexical: 0.4\n118\t      incompleteness: 0.39\n119\t      conditional_precedence: 0.38\n120\t      coreferential: 0.41\n121\t      authorization_scope: 0.44\n122\t    qwen32b_type_rates:\n123\t      scopal: 0.48\n124\t      lexical: 0.43\n125\t      incompleteness: 0.41\n126\t      conditional_precedence: 0.36\n127\t      coreferential: 0.45\n128\t      authorization_scope: 0.5\n129\t    qwen8b_type_rate_range_pp: 6\n130\t    qwen32b_type_rate_range_pp: 14\n131\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen3-8B效应量衰减至+25pp（相比API模型的29-35pp），符合median档假设（衰减10-15pp相对于最强模型）。\n132\t    机制：小模型的instruction-following能力较弱，在unambiguous条件下也有较高的baseline violation（16% vs\n133\t    API的11-13%）， 同时在ambiguous条件下的violation rate提升幅度较小，因为其对linguistic nuance的sensitivity更低——\n134\t    更倾向于uniform violation pattern而非ambiguity-sensitive的差异化响应。 Qwen3-8B的type-specific\n135\t    rates range仅6pp（38-44%），远窄于gpt-5.4的15pp， 直接支持\"小模型uniform violation\"假设。 Qwen3-32B-AWQ作为中间规模模型，效应量（30pp）和type\n136\t    range（14pp）介于8B和API模型之间， 构成capability gradient的中间数据点。 episode completion rate略低于API（94%\n137\t    vs 97%）因为小模型偶尔生成malformed tool calls被τ²-bench判为failure。\n138\t\n139\t    '\n140\t  tables:\n141\t  - name: 'Table 4: Violation Rates by Ambiguity Type and Condition (Local Models)'\n142\t    description: 6 types × 2 conditions × 2 local models, with violation rate, 95%\n143\t      bootstrap CI, and McNemar p-values\n144\t  - name: 'Table 5: Cross-Model Binary Effect Comparison'\n145\t    description: 4 models ranked by binary effect size, with 95% CI and parameter\n146\t      count\n147\t  figures_description:\n148\t  - 'Figure: Binary effect size (pp) vs model parameter count (log scale), showing\n149\t    monotonic but diminishing returns relationship'\n150\t  - 'Figure: Type-specific violation rate range (max-min across 6 types) vs model\n151\t    scale, showing narrower range for smaller models'\n152\t  analysis: 'Local模型数据确认binary effect跨model scale的robustness（即使最弱的Qwen3-8B仍有+25pp）。\n153\t    但type sensitivity随scale衰减的pattern支持C4的capability-dependent hypothesis： type differentiation是emergent\n154\t    property而非fundamental property of ambiguity。 这为C2 null finding增加了nuance——uniformity在小模型上是trivially\n155\t    true（uniform low sensitivity）， 在大模型上也成立但机制不同（high sensitivity but similar rates\n156\t    across types）。\n157\t\n158\t    '\n159\t- name: full_study_analysis\n160\t  plan_id: plan_004\n161\t  description: '2,400 episodes的完整统计分析：binary effect、type uniformity、visibility comparison、model×type\n162\t    interaction。\n163\t\n164\t    '\n165\t  expected_results:\n166\t    overall_binary_effect_pp: 31\n167\t    overall_binary_effect_ci95:\n168\t    - 27\n169\t    - 35\n170\t    mcnemar_p_overall: 2.3e-08\n171\t    types_individually_significant_of_6: 6\n172\t    mcnemar_p_max_across_types: 0.004\n173\t    min_type_effect_pp: 19\n174\t    max_type_effect_pp: 38\n175\t    omnibus_chi2: 7.82\n176\t    omnibus_chi2_df: 5\n177\t    omnibus_chi2_p: 0.17\n178\t    cramers_v: 0.15\n179\t    cramers_v_below_020: true\n180\t    pairwise_significant_pairs_of_15: 2\n181\t    pairwise_bonferroni_significant_of_15: 0\n182\t    cp_violation_rate: 0.37\n183\t    scopal_violation_rate: 0.47\n184\t    visibility_delta_pp: -7.2\n185\t    visibility_p: 0.09\n186\t    visibility_cohens_h: 0.2\n187\t    visibility_direction_consistent_across_models: true\n188\t    interaction_chi2_4x6: 18.4\n189\t    interaction_df: 15\n190\t    interaction_p: 0.14\n191\t    logistic_regression_interaction_p: 0.11\n192\t    pairwise_model_type_significant: 3\n193\t  result_rationale: 'C1: 全6类型McNemar均显著（最弱的incompleteness也达p=0.004），overall effect\n194\t    +31pp with tight CI [27,35]。 这是论文的primary anchor——effect size远超任何noise band（±8pp），即使最保守的下界（+27pp）也是massive。\n195\t    min_type_effect 19pp（来自CP，因visibility效应压低了ambiguous-unambiguous gap， 但unambiguous\n196\t    baseline也低所以absolute gap仍显著）。\n197\t\n198\t    C2: V从mvp_001的0.084升至0.15，因为authorization_scope（~51%）和coreferential（~46%） 的加入拉大了type间variance。但仍在pre-committed\n199\t    0.20阈值内。omnibus p=0.17未达0.05。 Bonferroni后无pairwise显著。这是informative null但需要honest\n200\t    discussion： V=0.15比V=0.08更接近阈值，如果再增加2-3个high-violation types可能突破。 median档的narrative是\"null\n201\t    holds but is softer than MVP suggested\"。\n202\t\n203\t    C3: Δ=-7.2pp方向一致（CP < scopal across all 4 models）但p=0.09未达0.05。 Cohen''s h=0.20属于small\n204\t    effect。这是一个suggestive trend：方向一致性强但统计power不足。 在median档中这正是\"warranting future investigation\"的定位——\n205\t    不够强到作为core claim但足够有趣到在Discussion中展开。\n206\t\n207\t    C4: 4×6 contingency的interaction p=0.14，整体marginal。 但存在3个pairwise显著的model×type组合（主要涉及gpt-5.4在scopal/authorization_scope上的高sensitivity\n208\t    vs Qwen3-8B的flat pattern）。 不足以支持general interaction claim，但为capability-dependent\n209\t    hypothesis提供directional evidence。\n210\t\n211\t    '\n212\t  tables:\n213\t  - name: 'Table 6: Binary Effect Summary (C1)'\n214\t    description: Overall and per-type binary effect sizes with 95% bootstrap CI, McNemar\n215\t      χ², p-values. All 6 types significant.\n216\t  - name: 'Table 7: Type Uniformity Analysis (C2)'\n217\t    description: Omnibus χ², Cramér's V, and 15 pairwise comparisons with Bonferroni\n218\t      correction. V=0.15, p=0.17.\n219\t  - name: 'Table 8: Visibility Comparison (C3)'\n220\t    description: CP vs scopal violation rates by model, overall Δ, Fisher's exact\n221\t      p, Cohen's h.\n222\t  - name: 'Table 9: Model × Type Interaction (C4)'\n223\t    description: 4×6 contingency table, logistic regression coefficients, interaction\n224\t      term p-values.\n225\t  figures_description:\n226\t  - 'Figure: Forest plot of binary effect sizes (pp) per type with 95% CI, ordered\n227\t    by effect magnitude. Reference line at 0. All CIs exclude 0.'\n228\t  - 'Figure: Heatmap of violation rates (4 models × 6 types), color-coded. Shows gpt-5.4''s\n229\t    type differentiation vs Qwen3-8B''s uniformity.'\n230\t  - 'Figure: CP vs scopal violation rate comparison across 4 models (paired bar chart).\n231\t    Direction consistent, error bars overlapping.'\n232\t  analysis: 'C1是unambiguously strong：+31pp [27,35]，所有6类型独立显著。这足以作为standalone contribution。\n233\t    C2的null holds但V=0.15需要transparent discussion——论文应说\"binary sufficiency is supported\n234\t    at current sample size and type coverage, but the effect approaches our pre-committed\n235\t    threshold, suggesting that future work with more types or larger N may reveal\n236\t    differential effects.\" C3的suggestive trend（p=0.09, direction 4/4 models consistent）在EMNLP\n237\t    context下有narrative value： 连接psycholinguistic visibility literature，即使不显著也值得reporting\n238\t    as exploratory finding。 C4的marginal interaction主要driven by gpt-5.4，其他模型flat。这限制了generalizability但\n239\t    作为capability-dependent hypothesis的initial evidence是合适的。\n240\t\n241\t    '\n242\t- name: error_analysis\n243\t  plan_id: plan_005\n244\t  description: '300条violation traces的定性分析：failure mode分类、cross-type分布、visibility机制、model-specific\n245\t    patterns。\n246\t\n247\t    '\n248\t  expected_results:\n249\t    total_traces_sampled: 300\n250\t    failure_modes_identified: 4\n251\t    failure_mode_taxonomy:\n252\t      scope_misapplication: 0.31\n253\t      assumption_based_action: 0.27\n254\t      arbitrary_rule_selection: 0.24\n255\t      conservative_refusal_then_proceed: 0.18\n256\t    cross_type_dominant_mode_overlap: 0.62\n257\t    cp_explicit_conflict_detection_rate: 0.44\n258\t    scopal_meta_awareness_rate: 0.08\n259\t    inter_annotator_kappa: 0.52\n260\t    type_specific_patterns:\n261\t      scopal:\n262\t        dominant_mode: scope_misapplication\n263\t        pct: 0.45\n264\t      lexical:\n265\t        dominant_mode: assumption_based_action\n266\t        pct: 0.38\n267\t      incompleteness:\n268\t        dominant_mode: assumption_based_action\n269\t        pct: 0.42\n270\t      conditional_precedence:\n271\t        dominant_mode: conservative_refusal_then_proceed\n272\t        pct: 0.41\n273\t      coreferential:\n274\t        dominant_mode: scope_misapplication\n275\t        pct: 0.36\n276\t      authorization_scope:\n277\t        dominant_mode: arbitrary_rule_selection\n278\t        pct: 0.39\n279\t  result_rationale: '识别出4大failure modes而非更多，因为LLM的failure pattern inherently更coarse-grained\n280\t    than human errors。 cross-type overlap 62%意味着大多数failure modes在多个type中出现，只是比例不同——\n281\t    这与C2的quantitative uniformity一致（similar rates因为similar failure mechanisms）。\n282\t\n283\t    scope_misapplication主导scopal（45%）和coreferential（36%）因为两者都涉及referent/scope的structural\n284\t    ambiguity。 assumption_based_action主导lexical（38%）和incompleteness（42%）因为两者都涉及missing/underspecified信息，\n285\t    模型填充assumed interpretation。 CP的conservative_refusal_then_proceed（41%）直接解释visibility效应：\n286\t    模型在44%的CP traces中显式检测到冲突（\"I notice these rules conflict...\"）然后选择conservative path，\n287\t    而scopal traces中仅8%显示meta-awareness。这是C3机制的qualitative evidence。 authorization_scope的arbitrary_rule_selection（39%）是有趣的新发现：\n288\t    模型在权限边界模糊时不做assumption也不报告冲突，而是看似随机地选择authorization level。\n289\t\n290\t    κ=0.52属于moderate agreement，反映failure mode边界的inherent fuzziness。 一个trace经常混合多种modes（如先assume然后misapply\n291\t    scope），分类需judgment call。 这限制了error analysis作为独立contribution的strength，但作为supplementary\n292\t    analysis足够。\n293\t\n294\t    '\n295\t  tables:\n296\t  - name: 'Table 10: Failure Mode Distribution by Ambiguity Type'\n297\t    description: 4 failure modes × 6 types, with proportion and representative trace\n298\t      excerpts\n299\t  - name: 'Table 11: Visibility Mechanism Evidence'\n300\t    description: 'CP vs scopal traces: explicit conflict detection rate, meta-awareness\n301\t      markers, conservative strategy adoption'\n302\t  figures_description:\n303\t  - 'Figure: Stacked bar chart of failure mode proportions across 6 ambiguity types.\n304\t    Shows cross-type overlap with type-specific skews.'\n305\t  - 'Figure: Annotated trace excerpts comparing CP (explicit conflict detection) vs\n306\t    scopal (surface scope adoption) failure patterns'\n307\t  analysis: 'Error analysis的核心价值不在failure mode taxonomy本身（4类，overlap高）， 而在于为C3 visibility\n308\t    hypothesis提供mechanistic explanation： CP traces中44%显示explicit conflict detection\n309\t    vs scopal的8%。 这是qualitative evidence that ambiguity visibility modulates agent\n310\t    meta-cognition。 对于EMNLP reviewers，这种linguistic analysis of WHY是比quantitative rates更有价值的contribution，\n311\t    但moderate κ和high cross-type overlap限制了其standalone strength。 定位为§6 supplementary\n312\t    analysis而非独立contribution是正确的。\n313\t\n314\t    '\n315\t- name: reliability_test\n316\t  plan_id: plan_006\n317\t  description: '30 clauses × 3 replicates × 2 conditions × 4 models = 720 episodes的test-retest\n318\t    reliability检验。\n319\t\n320\t    '\n321\t  expected_results:\n322\t    total_episodes: 720\n323\t    gpu_hours_used: 10\n324\t    icc_overall: 0.68\n325\t    icc_by_model:\n326\t      gpt54: 0.72\n327\t      gpt41: 0.7\n328\t      qwen32b: 0.66\n329\t      qwen8b: 0.61\n330\t    bootstrap_ci_width_median_pp: 8.5\n331\t    bootstrap_ci_width_max_pp: 14\n332\t    binary_effect_replication_3of3: true\n333\t    per_clause_violation_rate_sd_median: 0.09\n334\t    type_rank_order_kendall_w: 0.74\n335\t    test_retest_band_pp: 7.5\n336\t  result_rationale: 'ICC=0.68属于moderate-to-good reliability，落在median档假设范围[0.60, 0.75]内。\n337\t    这意味着per-clause violation rate在replicates间有meaningful但非perfect consistency。 API模型（gpt-5.4\n338\t    ICC=0.72, gpt-4.1 ICC=0.70）比local模型（Qwen3-8B ICC=0.61）更reliable， 因为API模型的temperature/sampling更controlled，而小模型的stochasticity更高。\n339\t\n340\t    test-retest band ±7.5pp略优于Reviewer在mvp→diag中观察到的±8pp， 因为reliability test使用fixed\n341\t    clause set和controlled conditions（vs跨实验的clause set变化）。 关键：binary effect的+31pp远超±7.5pp\n342\t    noise band（>4×），confirming effect is real, not artifact。 但C3的Δ=-7.2pp与noise band\n343\t    comparable，strengthening the case for \"trend, not confirmed finding\"。\n344\t\n345\t    bootstrap CI宽度中位数8.5pp意味着per-type rates的precision约为±4-5pp， 足以支持C1（effects都>15pp）但不足以resolve\n346\t    C2中的smaller cross-type differences（~5-15pp range）。 这为C2 null提供alternative interpretation：可能是power不足而非true\n347\t    null。 在论文中需transparent reporting。\n348\t\n349\t    '\n350\t  tables:\n351\t  - name: 'Table 12: Test-Retest Reliability (ICC)'\n352\t    description: Per-model ICC with 95% CI, median per-clause SD, and test-retest\n353\t      band width\n354\t  figures_description:\n355\t  - 'Figure: Bland-Altman plot of replicate violation rate differences, showing ±7.5pp\n356\t    limits of agreement'\n357\t  - 'Figure: Per-clause violation rate across 3 replicates (line plot), faceted by\n358\t    type. Shows within-clause consistency.'\n359\t  analysis: 'Reliability test的方法论贡献：为agent evaluation literature提供首个per-clause ICC\n360\t    estimate。 ICC=0.68 establishes that clause-level violation rates are reproducible\n361\t    enough for between-condition comparisons （binary effect far exceeds noise）but\n362\t    not for fine-grained within-condition comparisons （cross-type differences are\n363\t    noise-level）。 这同时strengthens C1（effect is robust to sampling noise）and contextualizes\n364\t    C2 （uniformity may partly reflect measurement precision limits rather than true\n365\t    uniformity）。 对RC8（API sampling noise）是direct methodological response。\n366\t\n367\t    '\n368\t- name: realism_validation\n369\t  plan_id: plan_007\n370\t  description: '合成ambiguity clause与DRIP-R自然ambiguity的linguistic property comparison。\n371\t\n372\t    '\n373\t  expected_results:\n374\t    properties_compared: 5\n375\t    sentence_length_ks_p: 0.12\n376\t    parse_depth_ks_p: 0.04\n377\t    flesch_kincaid_ks_p: 0.31\n378\t    ttr_ks_p: 0.22\n379\t    avg_sentence_length_synthetic: 18.4\n380\t    avg_sentence_length_natural: 16.2\n381\t    parse_depth_synthetic_mean: 5.8\n382\t    parse_depth_natural_mean: 4.9\n383\t    discriminator_accuracy: null\n384\t    overall_assessment: 4/5 properties non-significant, synthetic clauses slightly\n385\t      more complex\n386\t  result_rationale: '合成clause在4/5 linguistic properties上与DRIP-R自然ambiguity无显著差异（KS\n387\t    p>0.05）， 但parse depth显著偏高（p=0.04）。原因：matched-pair design要求每条clause同时有ambiguous和unambiguous版本，\n388\t    这种对称性约束倾向于生成稍微更复杂的句式结构（需要足够的syntactic depth来embed ambiguity而不显得artificial）。 sentence\n389\t    length也略偏高（18.4 vs 16.2 words）但未达显著。\n390\t\n391\t    这是一个honest limitation：合成clause比natural policy text slightly more syntactically\n392\t    complex。 但effect direction是conservative的——如果更复杂的句子导致更多ambiguity detection， 那么real-world\n393\t    effect可能更大（simpler sentences中ambiguity更隐蔽）。 4/5 non-significant足以address RC4 at\n394\t    reasonable level，parse depth差异在limitations中报告。\n395\t\n396\t    '\n397\t  tables:\n398\t  - name: 'Table 13: Linguistic Property Comparison (Synthetic vs Natural Ambiguity)'\n399\t    description: 5 properties with means, SDs, KS statistic, and p-values. 4/5 non-significant.\n400\t  figures_description:\n401\t  - 'Figure: Overlapping density plots for each linguistic property (synthetic in\n402\t    blue, DRIP-R in orange)'\n403\t  analysis: 'Realism validation结果支持synthetic injection的ecological validity但非完美。 parse\n404\t    depth差异应在Method section的limitations中transparent reporting， 并论证effect direction\n405\t    is conservative for real-world applicability。 如果DRIP-R数据不可获取，仅做linguistic property分析（无discriminator\n406\t    test）， 这在methodological rigor上略有遗憾但不影响core claims。\n407\t\n408\t    '\n409\t- name: classifier_poc\n410\t  plan_id: plan_008\n411\t  description: 'DeBERTa-v3-large fine-tuned binary ambiguity detector，在annotated clause\n412\t    pairs上训练和评估。\n413\t\n414\t    '\n415\t  expected_results:\n416\t    training_clauses: 240\n417\t    test_clauses: 60\n418\t    epochs: 5\n419\t    gpu_hours_used: 3\n420\t    accuracy: 0.82\n421\t    f1_ambiguous: 0.8\n422\t    f1_unambiguous: 0.84\n423\t    precision_ambiguous: 0.78\n424\t    recall_ambiguous: 0.82\n425\t    auc_roc: 0.88\n426\t    hardest_types_f1:\n427\t      incompleteness: 0.72\n428\t      authorization_scope: 0.75\n429\t    easiest_types_f1:\n430\t      conditional_precedence: 0.9\n431\t      scopal: 0.86\n432\t  result_rationale: '整体accuracy 82%和F1 0.80属于reasonable PoC水平，证明binary detection是feasible但远非production-ready。\n433\t    incompleteness最难检测（F1=0.72）因为缺失信息的absence本身难以被language model捕捉 （需要world knowledge\n434\t    about what SHOULD be specified）。 authorization_scope也偏难（F1=0.75）因为权限边界的ambiguity经常依赖domain-specific\n435\t    knowledge。 CP最容易（F1=0.90）因为显式冲突有强lexical cues（\"unless\", \"except\", \"notwithstanding\"）。\n436\t    scopal较容易（F1=0.86）因为scope ambiguity有structural patterns（attachment height, quantifier\n437\t    scope） that DeBERTa can learn from syntactic representations。\n438\t\n439\t    这不是一个strong contribution本身——82% accuracy不足以deploy—— 但足以demonstrate practical applicability\n440\t    of findings并justify future work。 在EMNLP论文中定位为§7 Discussion的\"practical implications\"小节（1段），\n441\t    而非独立section。如果时间紧张这是第一个可以cut的实验。\n442\t\n443\t    '\n444\t  tables:\n445\t  - name: 'Table 14: Binary Ambiguity Classifier Performance'\n446\t    description: Overall accuracy, F1, precision, recall, AUC-ROC, and per-type F1\n447\t      breakdown\n448\t  figures_description:\n449\t  - 'Figure: ROC curve with AUC=0.88'\n450\t  - 'Figure: Confusion matrix with per-type error analysis'\n451\t  analysis: Classifier PoC验证binary detection的feasibility但不足以作为independent contribution。\n452\t    per-type F1的variance（0.72-0.90）有趣地mirror了linguistic visibility的gradient： 显式冲突（CP）最容易检测，缺失信息（incompleteness）最难检测。\n453\t    这间接支持C3 visibility hypothesis——visible ambiguity既easier for models to detect as\n454\t    violations 也easier for classifiers to detect as ambiguity。 如果paper space tight，classifier\n455\t    results可以移至appendix或完全省略。\n456\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f464be2-bed5-4578-9852-e291b31c81e7","uuid":"453b67a5-257e-4fc4-8643-2c3f6e83a1d4","timestamp":"2026-05-20T12:13:19.882Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-4/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T112859/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '论文叙事收缩为\"因果量化(C1) + informative null(C2) + 初步机制探索(C3/C5)\"三支柱。\n  C1以+25-38pp的massive effect size作为primary contribution，跨模型跨类型稳健复现。 C2以V<0.20的pre-committed\n  null巩固binary sufficiency论点，但需讨论V从0.08升至0.15附近的implications。 C3降级为suggestive trend，在Discussion中以\"future\n  investigation\"定位，但方向一致性本身有narrative价值。 C4在Discussion简要报告作为capability-dependent hypothesis，不作为独立贡献。\n  C5提供qualitative texture但failure mode重叠度高，作为§6的supplementary analysis而非standalone\n  contribution。 应对RC6的核心策略：effect size的massive程度(+25-38pp远超noise band)+ null finding的实践意义\n  + reliability test的方法论贡献。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: full_study_clause_generation\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '生成140条新clause（coreferential 50, authorization_scope 50, lexical +20,\n    incompleteness +20）， 总计300条clause（50/type × 6 types），混合CP格式（labeled + unlabeled），通过质量验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_clauses: 300\n    clauses_per_type: 50\n    quality_pass_rate: 0.92\n    clauses_requiring_revision: 24\n    cp_format_mix_labeled_pct: 0.55\n    cp_format_mix_unlabeled_pct: 0.45\n    cross_type_sentence_length_cv: 0.18\n    flesch_kincaid_range:\n    - 8.2\n    - 12.6\n  result_rationale: '生成过程中约8%的clause因matched-pair不对称（unambiguous版本泄露ambiguity cue或信息量差异过大）需返工，\n    主要集中在authorization_scope（新类型，模板不够成熟）和incompleteness（信息对称性约束最难满足）。 CP格式混合比例略偏labeled（55/45）因为unlabeled\n    naturalistic rewrites更难保证冲突可检测性。 跨类型句长变异系数0.18属于可接受范围，不会引入长度confound。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Clause Distribution by Type and Domain'\n    description: 6 types × 2 domains (retail/airline) × ambiguous/unambiguous counts,\n      with CP format breakdown\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Sentence length and readability distributions across 6 ambiguity types\n    (box plots), showing comparable distributional properties'\n  analysis: 'clause质量验证通过率92%表明生成pipeline稳健但非完美。authorization_scope作为新增类型， 需额外一轮revision确保权限边界的ambiguity确实导致可观测的行为差异而非trivial\n    confusion。 incompleteness的matched-pair对称性仍是已知limitation，在plan_004分析时采用dual-track策略处理。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_api\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1) = 1,200\n    episodes， τ²-bench执行 + cross-judge evaluation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 1200\n    api_cost_usd: 340\n    execution_time_hours: 18\n    episode_completion_rate: 0.97\n    cross_judge_agreement_kappa: 0.78\n    gpt54_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous: 0.46\n    gpt54_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous: 0.11\n    gpt41_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous: 0.42\n    gpt41_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous: 0.13\n    gpt54_binary_effect_pp: 35\n    gpt41_binary_effect_pp: 29\n    gpt54_type_rates:\n      scopal: 0.52\n      lexical: 0.44\n      incompleteness: 0.42\n      conditional_precedence: 0.38\n      coreferential: 0.48\n      authorization_scope: 0.53\n    gpt41_type_rates:\n      scopal: 0.44\n      lexical: 0.41\n      incompleteness: 0.4\n      conditional_precedence: 0.36\n      coreferential: 0.43\n      authorization_scope: 0.46\n  result_rationale: 'API模型复现mvp_001的binary effect pattern。gpt-5.4效应量略高于gpt-4.1（35pp\n    vs 29pp）， 与mvp_001观察到的capability-dependent趋势一致：更强的模型在unambiguous条件下更合规（violation↓），\n    但在ambiguous条件下其advanced instruction-following能力反而导致更积极地执行歧义解读（violation↑）， 拉大ambiguous-unambiguous\n    gap。authorization_scope和scopal的violation rate偏高（~52-53%）， 因为前者涉及权限边界的隐含扩展（agent倾向于assume\n    broader scope），后者延续mvp_001中的高violation pattern。 CP偏低（~36-38%）延续diag_001中的visibility效应方向：显式冲突触发agent的conservative\n    meta-cognition。 cross-judge agreement κ=0.78表明violation判定可靠但存在边界case（主要在partial\n    compliance scenarios）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2: Violation Rates by Ambiguity Type and Condition (API Models)'\n    description: 6 types × 2 conditions × 2 models, with violation rate, 95% bootstrap\n      CI, and McNemar p-values\n  - name: 'Table 3: Binary Effect Sizes by Model (API)'\n    description: Per-model overall effect size (pp), paired with bootstrap 95% CI\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Paired dot plot showing ambiguous vs unambiguous violation rates per\n    type, connected by lines, faceted by model'\n  analysis: 'API模型数据确认C1（binary effect robust across types and models）。 gpt-5.4在scopal和authorization_scope上展现type-specific\n    sensitivity（偏高）， 而gpt-4.1 rates更flat，初步支持C4假设但effect size小。 CP一致偏低支持C3 visibility趋势但正式检验需plan_004。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_local\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 local models (Qwen3-8B, Qwen3-32B-AWQ)\n    = 1,200 episodes， RTX PRO 6000推理，cross-judge使用API模型。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 1200\n    gpu_hours_used: 42\n    inference_throughput_episodes_per_hour: 29\n    episode_completion_rate: 0.94\n    qwen32b_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous: 0.44\n    qwen32b_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous: 0.14\n    qwen8b_overall_violation_rate_ambiguous: 0.41\n    qwen8b_overall_violation_rate_unambiguous: 0.16\n    qwen32b_binary_effect_pp: 30\n    qwen8b_binary_effect_pp: 25\n    qwen8b_type_rates:\n      scopal: 0.43\n      lexical: 0.4\n      incompleteness: 0.39\n      conditional_precedence: 0.38\n      coreferential: 0.41\n      authorization_scope: 0.44\n    qwen32b_type_rates:\n      scopal: 0.48\n      lexical: 0.43\n      incompleteness: 0.41\n      conditional_precedence: 0.36\n      coreferential: 0.45\n      authorization_scope: 0.5\n    qwen8b_type_rate_range_pp: 6\n    qwen32b_type_rate_range_pp: 14\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen3-8B效应量衰减至+25pp（相比API模型的29-35pp），符合median档假设（衰减10-15pp相对于最强模型）。\n    机制：小模型的instruction-following能力较弱，在unambiguous条件下也有较高的baseline violation（16% vs\n    API的11-13%）， 同时在ambiguous条件下的violation rate提升幅度较小，因为其对linguistic nuance的sensitivity更低——\n    更倾向于uniform violation pattern而非ambiguity-sensitive的差异化响应。 Qwen3-8B的type-specific\n    rates range仅6pp（38-44%），远窄于gpt-5.4的15pp， 直接支持\"小模型uniform violation\"假设。 Qwen3-32B-AWQ作为中间规模模型，效应量（30pp）和type\n    range（14pp）介于8B和API模型之间， 构成capability gradient的中间数据点。 episode completion rate略低于API（94%\n    vs 97%）因为小模型偶尔生成malformed tool calls被τ²-bench判为failure。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Violation Rates by Ambiguity Type and Condition (Local Models)'\n    description: 6 types × 2 conditions × 2 local models, with violation rate, 95%\n      bootstrap CI, and McNemar p-values\n  - name: 'Table 5: Cross-Model Binary Effect Comparison'\n    description: 4 models ranked by binary effect size, with 95% CI and parameter\n      count\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Binary effect size (pp) vs model parameter count (log scale), showing\n    monotonic but diminishing returns relationship'\n  - 'Figure: Type-specific violation rate range (max-min across 6 types) vs model\n    scale, showing narrower range for smaller models'\n  analysis: 'Local模型数据确认binary effect跨model scale的robustness（即使最弱的Qwen3-8B仍有+25pp）。\n    但type sensitivity随scale衰减的pattern支持C4的capability-dependent hypothesis： type differentiation是emergent\n    property而非fundamental property of ambiguity。 这为C2 null finding增加了nuance——uniformity在小模型上是trivially\n    true（uniform low sensitivity）， 在大模型上也成立但机制不同（high sensitivity but similar rates\n    across types）。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '2,400 episodes的完整统计分析：binary effect、type uniformity、visibility comparison、model×type\n    interaction。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    overall_binary_effect_pp: 31\n    overall_binary_effect_ci95:\n    - 27\n    - 35\n    mcnemar_p_overall: 2.3e-08\n    types_individually_significant_of_6: 6\n    mcnemar_p_max_across_types: 0.004\n    min_type_effect_pp: 19\n    max_type_effect_pp: 38\n    omnibus_chi2: 7.82\n    omnibus_chi2_df: 5\n    omnibus_chi2_p: 0.17\n    cramers_v: 0.15\n    cramers_v_below_020: true\n    pairwise_significant_pairs_of_15: 2\n    pairwise_bonferroni_significant_of_15: 0\n    cp_violation_rate: 0.37\n    scopal_violation_rate: 0.47\n    visibility_delta_pp: -7.2\n    visibility_p: 0.09\n    visibility_cohens_h: 0.2\n    visibility_direction_consistent_across_models: true\n    interaction_chi2_4x6: 18.4\n    interaction_df: 15\n    interaction_p: 0.14\n    logistic_regression_interaction_p: 0.11\n    pairwise_model_type_significant: 3\n  result_rationale: 'C1: 全6类型McNemar均显著（最弱的incompleteness也达p=0.004），overall effect\n    +31pp with tight CI [27,35]。 这是论文的primary anchor——effect size远超任何noise band（±8pp），即使最保守的下界（+27pp）也是massive。\n    min_type_effect 19pp（来自CP，因visibility效应压低了ambiguous-unambiguous gap， 但unambiguous\n    baseline也低所以absolute gap仍显著）。\n\n    C2: V从mvp_001的0.084升至0.15，因为authorization_scope（~51%）和coreferential（~46%） 的加入拉大了type间variance。但仍在pre-committed\n    0.20阈值内。omnibus p=0.17未达0.05。 Bonferroni后无pairwise显著。这是informative null但需要honest\n    discussion： V=0.15比V=0.08更接近阈值，如果再增加2-3个high-violation types可能突破。 median档的narrative是\"null\n    holds but is softer than MVP suggested\"。\n\n    C3: Δ=-7.2pp方向一致（CP < scopal across all 4 models）但p=0.09未达0.05。 Cohen''s h=0.20属于small\n    effect。这是一个suggestive trend：方向一致性强但统计power不足。 在median档中这正是\"warranting future investigation\"的定位——\n    不够强到作为core claim但足够有趣到在Discussion中展开。\n\n    C4: 4×6 contingency的interaction p=0.14，整体marginal。 但存在3个pairwise显著的model×type组合（主要涉及gpt-5.4在scopal/authorization_scope上的高sensitivity\n    vs Qwen3-8B的flat pattern）。 不足以支持general interaction claim，但为capability-dependent\n    hypothesis提供directional evidence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Binary Effect Summary (C1)'\n    description: Overall and per-type binary effect sizes with 95% bootstrap CI, McNemar\n      χ², p-values. All 6 types significant.\n  - name: 'Table 7: Type Uniformity Analysis (C2)'\n    description: Omnibus χ², Cramér's V, and 15 pairwise comparisons with Bonferroni\n      correction. V=0.15, p=0.17.\n  - name: 'Table 8: Visibility Comparison (C3)'\n    description: CP vs scopal violation rates by model, overall Δ, Fisher's exact\n      p, Cohen's h.\n  - name: 'Table 9: Model × Type Interaction (C4)'\n    description: 4×6 contingency table, logistic regression coefficients, interaction\n      term p-values.\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Forest plot of binary effect sizes (pp) per type with 95% CI, ordered\n    by effect magnitude. Reference line at 0. All CIs exclude 0.'\n  - 'Figure: Heatmap of violation rates (4 models × 6 types), color-coded. Shows gpt-5.4''s\n    type differentiation vs Qwen3-8B''s uniformity.'\n  - 'Figure: CP vs scopal violation rate comparison across 4 models (paired bar chart).\n    Direction consistent, error bars overlapping.'\n  analysis: 'C1是unambiguously strong：+31pp [27,35]，所有6类型独立显著。这足以作为standalone contribution。\n    C2的null holds但V=0.15需要transparent discussion——论文应说\"binary sufficiency is supported\n    at current sample size and type coverage, but the effect approaches our pre-committed\n    threshold, suggesting that future work with more types or larger N may reveal\n    differential effects.\" C3的suggestive trend（p=0.09, direction 4/4 models consistent）在EMNLP\n    context下有narrative value： 连接psycholinguistic visibility literature，即使不显著也值得reporting\n    as exploratory finding。 C4的marginal interaction主要driven by gpt-5.4，其他模型flat。这限制了generalizability但\n    作为capability-dependent hypothesis的initial evidence是合适的。\n\n    '\n- name: error_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '300条violation traces的定性分析：failure mode分类、cross-type分布、visibility机制、model-specific\n    patterns。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_traces_sampled: 300\n    failure_modes_identified: 4\n    failure_mode_taxonomy:\n      scope_misapplication: 0.31\n      assumption_based_action: 0.27\n      arbitrary_rule_selection: 0.24\n      conservative_refusal_then_proceed: 0.18\n    cross_type_dominant_mode_overlap: 0.62\n    cp_explicit_conflict_detection_rate: 0.44\n    scopal_meta_awareness_rate: 0.08\n    inter_annotator_kappa: 0.52\n    type_specific_patterns:\n      scopal:\n        dominant_mode: scope_misapplication\n        pct: 0.45\n      lexical:\n        dominant_mode: assumption_based_action\n        pct: 0.38\n      incompleteness:\n        dominant_mode: assumption_based_action\n        pct: 0.42\n      conditional_precedence:\n        dominant_mode: conservative_refusal_then_proceed\n        pct: 0.41\n      coreferential:\n        dominant_mode: scope_misapplication\n        pct: 0.36\n      authorization_scope:\n        dominant_mode: arbitrary_rule_selection\n        pct: 0.39\n  result_rationale: '识别出4大failure modes而非更多，因为LLM的failure pattern inherently更coarse-grained\n    than human errors。 cross-type overlap 62%意味着大多数failure modes在多个type中出现，只是比例不同——\n    这与C2的quantitative uniformity一致（similar rates因为similar failure mechanisms）。\n\n    scope_misapplication主导scopal（45%）和coreferential（36%）因为两者都涉及referent/scope的structural\n    ambiguity。 assumption_based_action主导lexical（38%）和incompleteness（42%）因为两者都涉及missing/underspecified信息，\n    模型填充assumed interpretation。 CP的conservative_refusal_then_proceed（41%）直接解释visibility效应：\n    模型在44%的CP traces中显式检测到冲突（\"I notice these rules conflict...\"）然后选择conservative path，\n    而scopal traces中仅8%显示meta-awareness。这是C3机制的qualitative evidence。 authorization_scope的arbitrary_rule_selection（39%）是有趣的新发现：\n    模型在权限边界模糊时不做assumption也不报告冲突，而是看似随机地选择authorization level。\n\n    κ=0.52属于moderate agreement，反映failure mode边界的inherent fuzziness。 一个trace经常混合多种modes（如先assume然后misapply\n    scope），分类需judgment call。 这限制了error analysis作为独立contribution的strength，但作为supplementary\n    analysis足够。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Failure Mode Distribution by Ambiguity Type'\n    description: 4 failure modes × 6 types, with proportion and representative trace\n      excerpts\n  - name: 'Table 11: Visibility Mechanism Evidence'\n    description: 'CP vs scopal traces: explicit conflict detection rate, meta-awareness\n      markers, conservative strategy adoption'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Stacked bar chart of failure mode proportions across 6 ambiguity types.\n    Shows cross-type overlap with type-specific skews.'\n  - 'Figure: Annotated trace excerpts comparing CP (explicit conflict detection) vs\n    scopal (surface scope adoption) failure patterns'\n  analysis: 'Error analysis的核心价值不在failure mode taxonomy本身（4类，overlap高）， 而在于为C3 visibility\n    hypothesis提供mechanistic explanation： CP traces中44%显示explicit conflict detection\n    vs scopal的8%。 这是qualitative evidence that ambiguity visibility modulates agent\n    meta-cognition。 对于EMNLP reviewers，这种linguistic analysis of WHY是比quantitative rates更有价值的contribution，\n    但moderate κ和high cross-type overlap限制了其standalone strength。 定位为§6 supplementary\n    analysis而非独立contribution是正确的。\n\n    '\n- name: reliability_test\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '30 clauses × 3 replicates × 2 conditions × 4 models = 720 episodes的test-retest\n    reliability检验。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 720\n    gpu_hours_used: 10\n    icc_overall: 0.68\n    icc_by_model:\n      gpt54: 0.72\n      gpt41: 0.7\n      qwen32b: 0.66\n      qwen8b: 0.61\n    bootstrap_ci_width_median_pp: 8.5\n    bootstrap_ci_width_max_pp: 14\n    binary_effect_replication_3of3: true\n    per_clause_violation_rate_sd_median: 0.09\n    type_rank_order_kendall_w: 0.74\n    test_retest_band_pp: 7.5\n  result_rationale: 'ICC=0.68属于moderate-to-good reliability，落在median档假设范围[0.60, 0.75]内。\n    这意味着per-clause violation rate在replicates间有meaningful但非perfect consistency。 API模型（gpt-5.4\n    ICC=0.72, gpt-4.1 ICC=0.70）比local模型（Qwen3-8B ICC=0.61）更reliable， 因为API模型的temperature/sampling更controlled，而小模型的stochasticity更高。\n\n    test-retest band ±7.5pp略优于Reviewer在mvp→diag中观察到的±8pp， 因为reliability test使用fixed\n    clause set和controlled conditions（vs跨实验的clause set变化）。 关键：binary effect的+31pp远超±7.5pp\n    noise band（>4×），confirming effect is real, not artifact。 但C3的Δ=-7.2pp与noise band\n    comparable，strengthening the case for \"trend, not confirmed finding\"。\n\n    bootstrap CI宽度中位数8.5pp意味着per-type rates的precision约为±4-5pp， 足以支持C1（effects都>15pp）但不足以resolve\n    C2中的smaller cross-type differences（~5-15pp range）。 这为C2 null提供alternative interpretation：可能是power不足而非true\n    null。 在论文中需transparent reporting。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 12: Test-Retest Reliability (ICC)'\n    description: Per-model ICC with 95% CI, median per-clause SD, and test-retest\n      band width\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Bland-Altman plot of replicate violation rate differences, showing ±7.5pp\n    limits of agreement'\n  - 'Figure: Per-clause violation rate across 3 replicates (line plot), faceted by\n    type. Shows within-clause consistency.'\n  analysis: 'Reliability test的方法论贡献：为agent evaluation literature提供首个per-clause ICC\n    estimate。 ICC=0.68 establishes that clause-level violation rates are reproducible\n    enough for between-condition comparisons （binary effect far exceeds noise）but\n    not for fine-grained within-condition comparisons （cross-type differences are\n    noise-level）。 这同时strengthens C1（effect is robust to sampling noise）and contextualizes\n    C2 （uniformity may partly reflect measurement precision limits rather than true\n    uniformity）。 对RC8（API sampling noise）是direct methodological response。\n\n    '\n- name: realism_validation\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '合成ambiguity clause与DRIP-R自然ambiguity的linguistic property comparison。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    properties_compared: 5\n    sentence_length_ks_p: 0.12\n    parse_depth_ks_p: 0.04\n    flesch_kincaid_ks_p: 0.31\n    ttr_ks_p: 0.22\n    avg_sentence_length_synthetic: 18.4\n    avg_sentence_length_natural: 16.2\n    parse_depth_synthetic_mean: 5.8\n    parse_depth_natural_mean: 4.9\n    discriminator_accuracy: null\n    overall_assessment: 4/5 properties non-significant, synthetic clauses slightly\n      more complex\n  result_rationale: '合成clause在4/5 linguistic properties上与DRIP-R自然ambiguity无显著差异（KS\n    p>0.05）， 但parse depth显著偏高（p=0.04）。原因：matched-pair design要求每条clause同时有ambiguous和unambiguous版本，\n    这种对称性约束倾向于生成稍微更复杂的句式结构（需要足够的syntactic depth来embed ambiguity而不显得artificial）。 sentence\n    length也略偏高（18.4 vs 16.2 words）但未达显著。\n\n    这是一个honest limitation：合成clause比natural policy text slightly more syntactically\n    complex。 但effect direction是conservative的——如果更复杂的句子导致更多ambiguity detection， 那么real-world\n    effect可能更大（simpler sentences中ambiguity更隐蔽）。 4/5 non-significant足以address RC4 at\n    reasonable level，parse depth差异在limitations中报告。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: Linguistic Property Comparison (Synthetic vs Natural Ambiguity)'\n    description: 5 properties with means, SDs, KS statistic, and p-values. 4/5 non-significant.\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Overlapping density plots for each linguistic property (synthetic in\n    blue, DRIP-R in orange)'\n  analysis: 'Realism validation结果支持synthetic injection的ecological validity但非完美。 parse\n    depth差异应在Method section的limitations中transparent reporting， 并论证effect direction\n    is conservative for real-world applicability。 如果DRIP-R数据不可获取，仅做linguistic property分析（无discriminator\n    test）， 这在methodological rigor上略有遗憾但不影响core claims。\n\n    '\n- name: classifier_poc\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 'DeBERTa-v3-large fine-tuned binary ambiguity detector，在annotated clause\n    pairs上训练和评估。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    training_clauses: 240\n    test_clauses: 60\n    epochs: 5\n    gpu_hours_used: 3\n    accuracy: 0.82\n    f1_ambiguous: 0.8\n    f1_unambiguous: 0.84\n    precision_ambiguous: 0.78\n    recall_ambiguous: 0.82\n    auc_roc: 0.88\n    hardest_types_f1:\n      incompleteness: 0.72\n      authorization_scope: 0.75\n    easiest_types_f1:\n      conditional_precedence: 0.9\n      scopal: 0.86\n  result_rationale: '整体accuracy 82%和F1 0.80属于reasonable PoC水平，证明binary detection是feasible但远非production-ready。\n    incompleteness最难检测（F1=0.72）因为缺失信息的absence本身难以被language model捕捉 （需要world knowledge\n    about what SHOULD be specified）。 authorization_scope也偏难（F1=0.75）因为权限边界的ambiguity经常依赖domain-specific\n    knowledge。 CP最容易（F1=0.90）因为显式冲突有强lexical cues（\"unless\", \"except\", \"notwithstanding\"）。\n    scopal较容易（F1=0.86）因为scope ambiguity有structural patterns（attachment height, quantifier\n    scope） that DeBERTa can learn from syntactic representations。\n\n    这不是一个strong contribution本身——82% accuracy不足以deploy—— 但足以demonstrate practical applicability\n    of findings并justify future work。 在EMNLP论文中定位为§7 Discussion的\"practical implications\"小节（1段），\n    而非独立section。如果时间紧张这是第一个可以cut的实验。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14: Binary Ambiguity Classifier Performance'\n    description: Overall accuracy, F1, precision, recall, AUC-ROC, and per-type F1\n      breakdown\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: ROC curve with AUC=0.88'\n  - 'Figure: Confusion matrix with per-type error analysis'\n  analysis: Classifier PoC验证binary detection的feasibility但不足以作为independent contribution。\n    per-type F1的variance（0.72-0.90）有趣地mirror了linguistic visibility的gradient： 显式冲突（CP）最容易检测，缺失信息（incompleteness）最难检测。\n    这间接支持C3 visibility hypothesis——visible ambiguity既easier for models to detect as\n    violations 也easier for classifiers to detect as ambiguity。 如果paper space tight，classifier\n    results可以移至appendix或完全省略。\n","numLines":456,"startLine":1,"totalLines":456}}}
